   "valid_until": "2027-06-30",
   "label": "koreksi emas E0 (GT1 holdout PMK10-B-4): the criterion is the fixed regular income the contract gives for January or the first month (case attribute contract_fixed_income); without it, the fixed regular income paid in that month (2027 extension)",
